<!--
  E-invoice demo: a German seller, a German public authority (XRechnung with Leitweg-ID), a French business
  customer (Peppol BIS, intra-community supply), and three invoices with consistent amounts:
  - EINV1001: 2 x 899.00 (19 %) with a 50.00 line promotion, 3 x 12.50 (7 %), shipping 9.90 (19 %);
              net 1795.40, VAT 334.00 + 2.63, total 2132.03; payment terms 30 days, 2 % discount in 10 days
  - EINV1002: intra-community supply to France, 2450.00 + shipping 45.00, no VAT (category K), total 2495.00
  - EINV1003: customer return credit note for one bike of EINV1001, 899.00 + 170.81 VAT = 1069.81
-->
